    <section class=\"poem middle\">\n      <h2>《寻隐者不遇》</h2>\n      <p class=\"author\">（唐-贾岛）</p>\n      <p class=\"lines\">松下问童子，<br>言师采药去。<br>只在此山中，<br>云深不知处。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"poem bottom\">\n      <h2>《咏鹅》</h2>\n      <p class=\"author\">（唐-骆宾王）</p>\n      <p class=\"lines\">鹅鹅鹅，<br>曲项向天歌。<br>白毛浮绿水，<br>红掌拨清波。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"poem bottom\">\n      <h2>《草》</h2>\n      <p class=\"author\">（唐-白居易）</p>\n      <p class=\"lines\">离离原上草，<br>一岁一枯荣。<br>野火烧不尽，<br>春风吹又生。</p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
